OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry in the morning with sunny
OL,6,Fspells. A mostly dry afternoon with
OL,7,Fstill plenty of bright spells, but
OL,8,Fmore by the way of cloud and the odd
OL,9,Flight shower possible.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FSome evening sunny spells and
OL,12,Fthen clear spells at first overnight.
OL,13,FGradually clouding over from the east
OL,14,Fwith the odd spot of light rain
OL,15,Fpossible in the west by morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
