OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloud and outbreaks of rain
OL,6,Fsoon spreading northeast through the
OL,7,Fmorning. Becoming dry but a bit breezy
OL,8,Fthrough the afternoon with some
OL,9,Fbrighter spells developing. Feeling
OL,10,Fwarm in any sunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,13,Fwith outbreaks of occasionally heavy
OL,14,Frain on Wednesday morning, likely
OL,15,Fturning brighter later with a few
OL,16,Fshowers. Bright spells and scattered
OL,17,Fshowers on Thursday and Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
